abstract: >
  We prove the Gibbons–Penrose inequality for smooth closed spacelike
  codimension-two submanifolds of Minkowski spacetime whose past null second
  fundamental form is non-negative. The proof is motivated by the
  Alexandrov–Bakelman–Pucci technique.
